sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Job as LMEval Container<br/>(Kubernetes Job)
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Model as Model Inference Endpoint<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over EvalHub,Job: Flow 1: Online Evaluation Job Execution
        EvalHub->>Job: Mount JobSpec ConfigMap<br/>/meta/job.json (K8s RBAC)
        Job->>Job: Parse JobSpec, resolve credentials<br/>from model auth secret
        Job->>EvalHub: POST callback: phase=INITIALIZING<br/>Bearer Token
        Job->>HF: GET tokenizer + datasets<br/>Bearer Token (HF_TOKEN)
        HF-->>Job: Tokenizer files, dataset splits
        Job->>EvalHub: POST callback: phase=RUNNING<br/>Bearer Token
        loop For each evaluation batch (num_concurrent ≤ 128)
            Job->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Bearer Token (OPENAI_API_KEY)
            Model-->>Job: Completion response
        end
        Job->>Job: Compute metrics<br/>(accuracy, F1, BLEU, etc.)
        Job->>EvalHub: POST callback: phase=COMPLETE<br/>+ evaluation results (Bearer Token)
        opt OCI export configured
            Job->>OCI: Push result artifact<br/>Docker auth config
        end
        opt MLflow configured
            Job->>MLflow: Log metrics + run metadata<br/>Bearer Token
        end
    end

    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over S3,Job: Flow 2: Air-Gapped Evaluation
        S3->>Job: Download cached models/datasets<br/>AWS IAM credentials (init container)
        Job->>Job: Auto-detect /test_data<br/>Set HF_DATASETS_OFFLINE=1
        Job->>EvalHub: POST callback: phase=RUNNING<br/>Bearer Token
        loop For each evaluation batch
            Job->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Bearer Token (OPENAI_API_KEY)
            Model-->>Job: Completion response
        end
        Job->>EvalHub: POST callback: phase=COMPLETE<br/>+ evaluation results (Bearer Token)
    end
